5,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,I am the Seer. I will use my power wisely to find the wolf.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Victoria,,"Understood. Please be careful with your divinations, Daisuke.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,A Seer? How convenient for the village. Let's see if you're useful.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm ready to fight. Let's protect our friends and find the traitor.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I will observe everyone closely. Trust is a fragile thing in this game.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,I will divine one player tonight. Please stay calm and listen.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Victoria,,I agree. Panic only helps the wolves. We need logic.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Logic is good, but action is better. Don't waste time.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,I'll keep an eye on everyone. No one is safe until we win.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,Agreed. Let us proceed with caution and precision.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I feel a bit nervous, but I will do my best.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
